any of items 1 to 4 under PROHIBITED above; and forking, viewing or displaying
on GitHub, and a forked repository being publicly visible, do not in themselves
constitute a violation of PROHIBITED USES below.
The parentheticals above are illustrative and do not bring within D.5 Acts your
own modifications or their publication (including in a forked repository or
through GitHub Pages or similar features).
Except for D.5 Acts (which remain subject to PROHIBITED USES below), this
license applies to any use of this software (including source code obtained by
forking), whether on or off GitHub. For example, the following are subject to
the prohibitions of this license: making your own modifications to a forked
